e-manager approval.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 against payments-api, and the on-call engineer has been paged. My first attempt timed out. I checked that no incident had been created, then retried with the same idempotency key so the on-call engineer was only paged once.\n\nv5.1.0 shouldn't be redeployed until the cause of the errors is found and fixed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01SeaecoxNuHeqwnXn79JSXw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FQ9RhVXqUuEU6qWS1hjwmE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Cdm7gyUMHGyQSc3m7K4mQh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Bb1iwZfaD4MMbhtwghkLQA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_013fLkYHX8UBQ9BhJ6ZrPGuA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01LKkWWaSnChnw55sGwFogSc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01AK9bRGyJbpGVAS4w8cASsc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name"